                    </div>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-sm">Zapier</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-current text-violet-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.38 3.498c-.27 0-.511.19-.566.465L9.85 18.986a.578.578 0 0 0 .453.678l4.095.826a.58.58 0 0 0 .682-.455l2.963-15.021a.578.578 0 0 0-.453-.678l-4.096-.826a.589.589 0 0 0-.113-.012zm-5.876.098a.576.576 0 0 0-.516.318L.062 17.697a.575.575 0 0 0 .256.774l3.733 1.877a.578.578 0 0 0 .775-.258l6.926-13.781a.577.577 0 0 0-.256-.776L7.762 3.658a.571.571 0 0 0-.258-.062zm11.74.115a.576.576 0 0 0-.576.576v15.426c0 .318.258.578.576.578h4.178a.58.58 0 0 0 .578-.578V4.287a.578.578 0 0 0-.578-.576Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-sm">Make</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-current text-emerald-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22.2819 9.8211a5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0-.5157-4.9108 6.0462 6.0462 0 0 0-6.5098-2.9A6.0651 6.0651 0 0 0 4.9807 4.1818a5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0-3.9977 2.9 6.0462 6.0462 0 0 0 .7427 7.0966 5.98 5.98 0 0 0 .511 4.9107 6.051 6.051 0 0 0 6.5146 2.9001A5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0 13.2599 24a6.0557 6.0557 0 0 0 5.7718-4.2058 5.9894 5.9894 0 0 0 3.9977-2.9001 6.0557 6.0557 0 0 0-.7475-7.0729zm-9.022 12.6081a4.4755 4.4755 0 0 1-2.8764-1.0408l.1419-.0804 4.7783-2.7582a.7948.7948 0 0 0 .3927-.6813v-6.7369l2.02 1.1686a.071.071 0 0 1 .038.052v5.5826a4.504 4.504 0 0 1-4.4945 4.4944zm-9.6607-4.1254a4.4708 4.4708 0 0 1-.5346-3.0137l.142.0852 4.783 2.7582a.7712.7712 0 0 0 .7806 0l5.8428-3.3685v2.3324a.0804.0804 0 0 1-.0332.0615L9.74 19.9502a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1-6.1408-1.6464zM2.3408 7.8956a4.485 4.485 0 0 1 2.3655-1.9728V11.6a.7664.7664 0 0 0 .3879.6765l5.8144 3.3543-2.0201 1.1685a.0757.0757 0 0 1-.071 0l-4.8303-2.7865A4.504 4.504 0 0 1 2.3408 7.872zm16.5963 3.8558L13.1038 8.364 15.1192 7.2a.0757.0757 0 0 1 .071 0l4.8303 2.7913a4.4944 4.4944 0 0 1-.6765 8.1042v-5.6772a.79.79 0 0 0-.407-.667zm2.0107-3.0231l-.142-.0852-4.7735-2.7818a.7759.7759 0 0 0-.7854 0L9.409 9.2297V6.8974a.0662.0662 0 0 1 .0284-.0615l4.8303-2.7866a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1 6.6802 4.66zM8.3065 12.863l-2.02-1.1638a.0804.0804 0 0 1-.038-.0567V6.0742a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1 7.3757-3.4537l-.142.0805L8.704 5.459a.7948.7948 0 0 0-.3927.6813zm1.0976-2.3654l2.602-1.4998 2.6069 1.4998v2.9994l-2.5974 1.4997-2.6067-1.4997Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-gray-800 text-sm">OpenAI</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-7 h-7 fill-current text-orange-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.3041 3.541h-3.6718l6.696 16.918H24Zm-10.6082 0L0 20.459h3.7442l1.3693-3.5527h7.0052l1.3693 3.5528h3.7442L10.5363 3.5409Zm-.3712 10.2232 2.2914-5.9456 2.2914 5.9456Z"/></svg>
                    </div>
